      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0.804,
          "end": 4.04,
          "en": "So let's continue working on",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4.04,
          "end": 6.41,
          "en": "the featured posts now,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 6.41,
          "end": 9.94,
          "en": "now that we added the navigation and so on.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 9.94,
          "end": 12.139,
          "en": "The goal of the featured posts component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 12.139,
          "end": 15.432,
          "en": "is to output some posts which we,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 15.432,
          "end": 18.828,
          "en": "as the owner of the block, marked as featured.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 18.828,
          "end": 20.816,
          "en": "Now, we will add posts",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 20.816,
          "end": 23.747,
          "en": "and mark them as featured in a later step",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 23.747,
          "end": 25.517,
          "en": "but we can already start",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 25.517,
          "end": 29.358,
          "en": "with outputting some dummy posts here for the moment.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 29.358,
          "end": 31.059,
          "en": "Therefore, in featured posts",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 31.059,
          "end": 35.178,
          "en": "I'll again create a basic component, featured posts",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 35.178,
          "end": 38.227,
          "en": "and, you've guessed it, we will export it,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 38.227,
          "end": 40.36,
          "en": "like we always did.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 40.36,
          "end": 43.331,
          "en": "Now we have a featured posts module CSS file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 43.331,
          "end": 46.301,
          "en": "and we will need it so we will import classes",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 46.301,
          "end": 51.301,
          "en": "from that featured posts module CSS file already.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 52.141,
          "end": 55.61,
          "en": "And then here, in that featured posts component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 55.61,
          "end": 58.411,
          "en": "I again want to create another section",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 58.411,
          "end": 63.13,
          "en": "which will receive a class of latest,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 63.13,
          "end": 65.95,
          "en": "because that's one of the classes that I pre-defined",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 65.95,
          "end": 67.658,
          "en": "in the CSS file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 67.658,
          "end": 72.658,
          "en": "Then a heading for this section where I say featured posts",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 73.104,
          "end": 78.104,
          "en": "and then below that a list of posts, or a grid of posts.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 79.24,
          "end": 82.67699999999999,
          "en": "And for this I'll actually create a separate component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 82.67699999999999,
          "end": 84.08,
          "en": "Why?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 84.08,
          "end": 88.635,
          "en": "Because we will then use that same list, or grid,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 88.635,
          "end": 92.369,
          "en": "as it will actually be on the all posts page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 92.369,
          "end": 96.89500000000001,
          "en": "On both the starting page in the featured posts component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 96.89500000000001,
          "end": 99.338,
          "en": "as well as on the all posts page,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 99.338,
          "end": 103.28,
          "en": "I want to output posts in the same way.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 103.28,
          "end": 108.28,
          "en": "I want to render a grid of post cards, so of post items.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 108.77000000000001,
          "end": 110.295,
          "en": "I want to render those as a grid",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 110.295,
          "end": 112.72999999999999,
          "en": "and these items then should be clickable",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 112.72999999999999,
          "end": 115.025,
          "en": "and take us to the individual post.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 115.025,
          "end": 118.455,
          "en": "The only difference is the number of posts",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 118.455,
          "end": 121.095,
          "en": "and the actual posts that are being rendered,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 121.095,
          "end": 125.8,
          "en": "but the way that they are presented will always be the same.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 125.8,
          "end": 128.085,
          "en": "Hence we can create a reusable component for that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 128.085,
          "end": 129.86599999999999,
          "en": "and that is what I will do.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 129.86599999999999,
          "end": 133.325,
          "en": "In the components folder I'll create a new sub-folder",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 133.325,
          "end": 135.154,
          "en": "which I'll name posts,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 135.154,
          "end": 139.495,
          "en": "which should hold all the posts specific components.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 139.495,
          "end": 142.255,
          "en": "And we could argue that featured posts",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 142.255,
          "end": 144.935,
          "en": "is also a posts specific component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 144.935,
          "end": 147.556,
          "en": "but it's even more specific to the home page",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 147.556,
          "end": 150.02,
          "en": "because we only use it there,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 150.02,
          "end": 152.603,
          "en": "which is why I keep it in the home page folder.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 153.536,
          "end": 155.525,
          "en": "Now, in that posts folder",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 155.525,
          "end": 159.785,
          "en": "I'll add a posts dash grid component file though",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 159.785,
          "end": 162.985,
          "en": "which will then render this grid of posts.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 162.985,
          "end": 165.797,
          "en": "And now for that posts grid,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 165.797,
          "end": 170.176,
          "en": "you already find a posts grid module CSS file attached",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 170.176,
          "end": 172.54500000000002,
          "en": "which we will need in a second,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 172.54500000000002,
          "end": 173.925,
          "en": "so you can download that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 173.925,
          "end": 178.21,
          "en": "and add it in the posts grid JavaScript file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 178.21,
          "end": 183.21,
          "en": "Now you'll also find attached a post item module CSS file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 183.63,
          "end": 186.142,
          "en": "and you can download and add that as well,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 186.142,
          "end": 188.42,
          "en": "also in the posts folder",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 188.42,
          "end": 193.42,
          "en": "because we will also create a post item JS file next to that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 193.54,
          "end": 196.144,
          "en": "which will hold a single post item.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 196.144,
          "end": 200.17000000000002,
          "en": "The post grid will render a couple of post items",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 200.17000000000002,
          "end": 203.3,
          "en": "and I'll split the grid and the actual items",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 203.3,
