          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 222.347,
          "end": 224.07,
          "en": "Of course, by the way,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 224.07,
          "end": 227.175,
          "en": "you could create a snippet for this in Visual Studio Code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 227.175,
          "end": 228.301,
          "en": "to save some time,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 228.301,
          "end": 230.987,
          "en": "but here I'll just write it manually all the time",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 230.987,
          "end": 234.42000000000002,
          "en": "and then in the posts grid component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
