          "en": "I do expect that I get props here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 254.916,
          "end": 259.916,
          "en": "and in my props I want to get a special posts prop.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 262.55,
          "end": 265.83,
          "en": "Now, the props name is up to you as its your component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 265.83,
          "end": 269.44,
          "en": "you just need to make sure that you then use that prop name",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 269.44,
          "end": 272.263,
          "en": "for passing data into this component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 272.263,
          "end": 275.899,
          "en": "So then I what to output my posts dynamically here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 275.899,
          "end": 280.85699999999997,
          "en": "by mapping every post into a post item",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 282.265,
          "end": 284.653,
          "en": "and we have yet to add this component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 284.653,
          "end": 286.72,
          "en": "but that's my goal here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
